0..78 Comment "// An omitted model implicit resolved (#739): a call that leaves out the model"
79..158 Comment "// a function quantifies over passes the one module in scope that is a model of"
159..235 Comment "// its theory at the types its explicit arguments force. No module is marked"
236..314 Comment "// as an instance: every module whose ascription is `Model(Count)`, or a model"
315..391 Comment "// of a theory including `Count`, is a candidate. `model-resolution-swapped`"
392..464 Comment "// imports the same two modules the other way round, and resolves alike."
